# Contributing

This repository follows the `managed-project-lifecycle` standard. See `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/project.json` for the project bootstrap and local configuration.

Meaningful changes require an Azure DevOps work item, a work-item branch, tests, current documentation, and a linked pull request. Work is complete only after merge.

Run the commands in `.agents/project.json`, update the authoritative document for each changed fact, and complete `.azuredevops/pull_request_template.md` before review.

